  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0\nBehaviour changes:\n- An unterminated quoted field in CSV now throws InvalidDataException instead of reading to the end of the file.\n- Any malformed or DTD-bearing XML part in an .xlsx now throws InvalidDataException naming the part, with the XmlException as InnerException. Catch InvalidDataException for any bad file.\n- Cell references past column XFD and row numbers past 1048576 throw InvalidDataException.\n\nFixes:\n- DTD processing is prohibited on every workbook XML part (entity expansion and external entities).\n- Rows missing from sheetData no longer shift later rows up.\n- Workbooks using the 1904 date system no longer read dates 1462 days early.\n- Phonetic runs (rPh) are no longer added to string text.\n- CsvReader.Read leaves the caller's stream open.\n- CellValue.AsString keeps the time for dates that have one.\n\nNew:\n- Encoding overloads for CSV: CsvReader.Read(Stream, Encoding, char), Spreadsheet.Read(Stream, SpreadsheetFormat, Encoding) and Spreadsheet.ReadFile(string, Encoding).\n- The package links the repository and ships the readme, icon and symbols.",
